    <innerclass refid="classfccvis_1_1scene_1_1BaseSessionObject" prot="public">fccvis::scene::BaseSessionObject</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespacefccvis">fccvis</innernamespace>
    <innernamespace refid="namespacefccvis_1_1scene">fccvis::scene</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for named objects belonging to a visualization session. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides a common identity mechanism for objects that are part of an FCCVisualization scene or session. Every derived object has a human-readable name that can be used to identify and reference it within the visualization configuration.</para>
